  "modules": [
    {
      "id": "uniequip_001_tomimi",
      "name": {
        "en": "Tomimi's Badge",
        "zh": "特米米证章",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "type": "INITIAL",
      "typeName2": "",
      "icon": "uniequip_001_tomimi",
      "description": {
        "en": "Operator Tomimi has demonstrated a remarkable aptitude for inflicting Arts casualties on the enemy.\nThe Field Operations Department has thus passed the following resolution:\nThis operator shall be appointed a Caster Operator during field operations to exercise Core Caster responsibilities.\nIn witness whereof,\nThis badge is hereby conferred upon the above named.",
        "zh": "干员特米米擅长对敌人造成法术杀伤\n根据外勤部门决议\n在外勤任务中划分为术师干员，行使中坚术师职责\n特别颁发此证章\n以兹证明",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "servers": [
        "cn",
        "global"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "uniequip_002_tomimi",
      "name": {
        "en": "Broken Tail Corrector",
        "zh": "损坏的尾尾佳",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "type": "ADVANCED",
      "typeName2": "Y",
      "icon": "uniequip_002_tomimi",
      "description": {
        "en": "(Relaxing music)\n'Hello there. Yes, you in front of the screen. Before we begin meditation, let's find the most snug chair to sit in that you can, and get nice and comfortable on it.'\nThat's gotta be this one. I can even stick my tail out between the seat and backrest.\nIt's a bit of a squeeze, but that's fine. The magazine said meditation helps you lose weight, so if I just clamp down where I want my weight to get lost, I bet it'll work even better.\n\n'Keep your body upright, don't lean back. Let your tail hang down naturally, and put your hands on your lap if you want. Relax your shoulders. Keep your airways open. Relax your core.'\nNo, I think I need to sit a little more firm.\nI cut out Gavial's signature from a medical history file last night. I need to be ready, just in case she comes looking for me.\n\n'First, we'll do some deep breathing. In... out. In... out.'\nIn—out—in—out—\n\n'And we'll repeat that, twelve times in total. In... out.'\nThat's so many times—wait, no, I need to stay focused! In, out! In, out!\n\n'Feel... your inner... peace.'\nMy cheeks are all hot. Does this count as peace? I guess so.\n\n'Close your eyes. Let all your pressure fall away. And then, inside your mind, picture a beautiful wish.'\nBeautiful wish? I want to be able to help Gavial out!\nIf Gavial wants to be a doctor, then I'll sort out everything else for her! I'll lead the tribe, I'll be a lord ameer, I'll even fight the fights I don't want to!\n\n'And then, hold that beautiful feeling inside your mind.'\nAnd then Gavial will praise me for doing good, and she'll say, Tomimi, you're the one I can count on most, you're always helping me out with stuff—\n\n'Now before your eyes, a beautiful scene is going to appear.'\nGavial... in front of me... telling me I'm the most reliable ever?!\nWaaaaaahhhh!\n\n'Now focus on your breathing...'\n'Yo, Tomimi. There you are.'\n'Ga-Ga-Ga-Ga-Gavial! Have I been helping you out?'\n\n'Don't try to control your breathing. Concentrate on the feelings that surround it...'\n'Huh? A bunch, I guess.'\n'Really?!'\n\n'Don't try to follow any thoughts...'\n'I mean, not the time with the rocket launcher. But down in Zeruertza, and when we headed back to Acahualla, right? You were right there helping me—hey, hold on, quit swishing your tail. You're gonna wreck that chair—'\nCrash.\n\n'Imagine yourself inhaling pure energy, exhaling your muddied, negative emotions...'\n'Gavial gave me that tail clamp just yesterdayyyyy!'",
        "zh": "（舒缓的音乐声）\n“屏幕前的你，在开始冥想之前，请找一把坐起来最舒服的椅子，舒服地坐在上面。”\n就是这一把了，正好可以把尾巴从靠背和座面之间的空隙伸出去。\n稍微有点挤，但是没关系。杂志上说冥想可以减肥，要是同时夹住想瘦的地方，效果肯定更好。\n\n“保持身体挺直，不要靠住椅背。尾巴自然下垂，双手可以放在腿上。放松肩膀，打开胸腔，放松腹部。”\n不行，还是得坐得紧绷一点。\n昨天偷偷把嘉维尔在病历本上的签名剪下来了。万一嘉维尔找过来，我得做好准备。\n\n“首先，做一组深呼吸。吸气，呼气。吸气，呼气。”\n吸——呼——吸——呼——\n\n“重复这一过程，一共十二次。吸气，呼气。”\n十二次，好多——不行，不能走神！吸、呼！吸、呼！\n\n“感受，内部的，平静。”\n脸蛋热热的，这样算是平静吗？算是吧。\n\n“闭上双眼，放下所有的压力，然后，心中生起美好的愿望。”\n美好的愿望？我希望自己能帮上嘉维尔的忙！\n嘉维尔想当医生，我就替她摆平别的事情，统领部族也好，当王酋也好，打不愿意打的架也好！\n\n“然后，在心里保持这种美好的感觉。”\n然后嘉维尔就会夸我做得好，她会说，特米米，还是你最可靠了，你总能帮上我的忙——\n\n“你的眼前浮现出美好场景的画面。”\n嘉维尔……在我眼前说……特米米最可靠？！\n呜啊啊啊啊！\n\n“把注意力转向呼吸……”\n“哟，特米米，你在这儿啊。”\n“嘉嘉嘉嘉嘉维尔！我有没有帮上你的忙？”\n\n“不要刻意控制呼吸，注意和呼吸有关的感觉……”\n“啊？还挺多的吧。”\n“真的？！”\n\n“不要追随任何生起的念头……”\n“用火箭筒那次就算了，不过在际崖城，还有回到阿卡胡拉的时候，你不都帮我——等等，你别乱甩尾巴，椅子要被你的尾巴顶坏了——”\n轰。\n\n“想象自己吸入纯净的能量，呼出浑浊的、负面的感受……”\n“嘉维尔昨天刚给我配的尾尾佳啊啊啊啊！”",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "servers": [
        "cn",
        "global"
      ],
